{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AMBL6zpBCj1792827334.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>韓聯社報道，朝鮮領袖金正恩到訪中國遼寧丹東，並在當地與總理李強會面。中朝雙方未有證實消息。</p><p></p><p>韓聯社引述韓國政府消息人士指，今次是金正恩相隔一年多再次訪華。共同社稍早前報道，丹東實施嚴格交通管制。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.KIM-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268agg3hw8s21792826730.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>韓聯社又指，金正恩是經新鴨綠江大橋入境中國。大橋全長約三千米，連接丹東及朝鮮新義州，早於2014年建成，但因朝方一側連接道路及口岸設施不完善等原因，延至本月15日才正式通車。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:41:58.787667+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T16:58:15.096651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:17.428656+00:00","content_hash":"31134d2f6a39239f3ce798955bb815bcc93a3522d7ee2af719c3c0807bbc3148","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}